OL,3,GNEWSADispersal order in place for
OL,4,ABoston v Scunthorpe
OL,5,
OL,6,FA dispersal order has been issued ahead
OL,7,Fof Boston United's home game against
OL,8,FScunthorpe United on Saturday.
OL,10,FLincolnshire Police said the order runs
OL,11,Ffrom 10:00 until 22:00 GMT and covers
OL,12,Fthe Jakemans Community Stadium and a
OL,13,Flarge part of the town.
OL,15,FOfficers said the order was authorised
OL,16,Ffollowing concerns that some people may
OL,17,Fbe planning to cause disruption.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
