OL,3,GNEWSADispersal order in place for
OL,4,ABoston v Scunthorpe
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe order gives police the power to
OL,7,Forder people to leave an area if they
OL,8,Fare, or are likely to engage in
OL,9,Fbehaviour such as harassment, crime or
OL,10,Fdisorder.
